This product is an MLX port of NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Diarization. Its inference
logic (feature extraction, Transformer encoder, Sortformer heads, streaming
speaker cache and segment post-processing) is a reimplementation of code from
NVIDIA NeMo (https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Speech), Copyright (c) NVIDIA
CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The model weights are not part of this repository. They are downloaded from
https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3-Diarization and are distributed by
NVIDIA under the OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1 (OpenMDW-1.1).
